  // Wire the WAI-ARIA tabs pattern on a [role="tablist"] of [role="tab"]
  // buttons: roving tabindex, aria-selected, an `.on` class for styling, and
  // keyboard support (Left/Right/Up/Down/Home/End). Calls onSelect(tabId,tab)
  // — tabId from data-tab — whenever a tab activates. Returns { select(id) } to
  // activate a tab programmatically. Reusable across the button editor and all
